repository-code: 'https://github.com/fhir-rust/fhir-rust/'
abstract: >-
  A Rust monorepo for HL7 FHIR: the FHIR R3/R4/R5 data model as
  serde-serializable Rust types generated from the official specification
  packages; six database ports that shred FHIR resources into real
  relational tables — typed columns, child tables, foreign keys, check
  constraints — and reconstruct them losslessly, across PostgreSQL,
  SQLite, MySQL, MariaDB, SQL Server and Oracle; an engine-agnostic
  persistence core carrying the tamper-evident audit chain; and a FHIR
  RESTful API server over one of those stores.
keywords:
  - FHIR
  - HL7
